OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies fear loss of lifeline
OL,4,Acharity over #75k shortfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week, Jan makes the journey from
OL,7,FGloucester to Herefordshire with her
OL,8,Fhusband Colin.
OL,10,FLiving with Parkinson's disease and
OL,11,Fdementia, Colin attends specialist
OL,12,Fsessions that his wife believes help
OL,13,Fkeep him active and independent.
OL,15,FBut the charity providing that support
OL,16,Fsays it faces a #75,000 funding
OL,17,Fshortfall and must raise the money
OL,18,Fbefore the end of the year to avoid
OL,19,Fcutting services.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
